            <p class="P2">(4)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Certificate of dedication: A certification by the subdivider setting forth the description of the areas and improvements he is dedicating to the public and the extent of the title which he is dedicating.</p>

            <p class="P2">(5)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Text of protective covenants whereby the subdivider proposes to regulate land use in the subdivision and otherwise protect the proposed development.</p>

            <p class="P2">(6)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Certificate of the city engineer, as follows:</p>

